WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Every journey begins somewhere.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:07.380
Mine started in a small village in India, fueled by a dream to shape my future through learning.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.920
I pursued a degree in Electrical and Electronics Engineering.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.840
It taught me to think systematically, trace problems to their roots, and seek evidence over assumptions.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.240
My first step into the software world was through testing.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.760
What began as a way to verify technology evolved into a craft,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.480
identifying potential failures before they impacted anyone.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:34.580
Over 18 years, that craft has grown into automation architecture, release leadership,

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.680
mentoring global teams, and AI quality engineering.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.260
I've dedicated my career to helping teams deliver with greater evidence and confidence.

